WEBVTT

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.740
<i>Maybe I didn't act</i>

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:10.920
<i>because a fear of taking risks 
caused me to hesitate.</i>

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:14.960
<i>But I'm done living like that.</i>

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.850
These are all the monsters I can lend you.

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:22.680
And only I can control this one.

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:24.020
What are you going to do?

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:26.140
Save Kagari.

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:27.630
I'll do everything I can.

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:29.380
Got it.

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:31.180
Where's Kagari?

00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:32.760
Okay, I see her.

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:38.790
<i>I wonder what she feels 
as she gazes at the city.</i>

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>Just what are "fond memories"?</i>

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:45.270
<i>I'm going to see for myself,</i>

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:49.350
<i>as a follower of Kagari, my lodestar.</i>

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:24.220
Episode 23
"Follower of the Lodestar"

00:02:29.530 --> 00:02:31.050
<i>That should do.</i>

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:33.500
<i>Feels like I'm playing an RPG 
after not touching one in ages.</i>

00:02:35.570 --> 00:02:37.630
Scout monsters are being hunted down?

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:41.260
If we know where, 
send in an investigation team.

00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:42.390
Sir.

00:02:43.070 --> 00:02:44.390
You go, too.

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:47.700
<i>The stage will be set soon.</i>

00:02:57.760 --> 00:02:59.530
You haven't found anything?

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:02.160
I'll put more men on it.

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:04.420
There must be something there.

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:06.010
Something...

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:28.180
Tear them to shreds.

00:03:28.780 --> 00:03:30.140
Don't leave any in one piece.

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:35.520
The missing search party was found dead.

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:37.650
Was it the Key?

00:03:39.270 --> 00:03:43.030
Send every last team we have there!

00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:08.010
<i>Sorry, Kagari.</i>

00:04:08.190 --> 00:04:10.030
<i>I need you to be my bait right now.</i>

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:11.770
<i>How much longer?</i>

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:16.830
<i>There they are!</i>

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:17.900
<i>Okay, get them!</i>

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:24.980
<i>Take out a summoner, 
and their monsters disappear.</i>

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:29.180
<i>My work here is done for tonight.</i>

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:32.110
<i>All that's left is to go through 
another nightmare.</i>

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:36.420
<i>Even so, I have to keep moving forward.</i>

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:41.190
"Martel showing signs of preparing 
a large-scale operation."

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:46.830
Is this for real?

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:48.080
Yeah.

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:50.090
Get everyone together later.

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:58.310
This is Oonishi. He was on Team Mikuni.

00:04:58.310 --> 00:04:59.270
Remember him?

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:01.660
Yeah, faintly.

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:03.090
Yo, long time no see.

00:05:03.090 --> 00:05:04.480
Tennouji, right?

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:06.910
I hear you went through a lot overseas.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.070
Yeah.

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:09.570
Awesome!

00:05:09.570 --> 00:05:11.790
You actually seem pretty strong now.

00:05:12.030 --> 00:05:16.310
<i>So he's the one with the 
eyes that can see Kagari.</i>

00:05:12.780 --> 00:05:14.790
Pleased to be working with you all.

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:23.530
Who are those people?

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:25.050
Oh, that's the choir.

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:27.800
The stars of the Harvest Festa ceremony.

00:05:34.970 --> 00:05:36.860
<i>Team Imamiya commencing investigation.</i>

00:05:36.860 --> 00:05:38.940
<i>Each squad is to report in 
with their current location.</i>

00:05:39.450 --> 00:05:40.350
What's the matter?

00:05:40.350 --> 00:05:43.460
Oh, I think I saw something 
over there just now.

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:44.280
What?

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:46.480
There! Gaia fanatics!

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:47.680
It's the hunters!

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:50.950
You head back and report this to 
command! Request backup, too!

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:52.200
Okay.

00:05:52.980 --> 00:05:56.270
<i>Scout monsters can't handle them.</i>

00:05:56.270 --> 00:05:58.460
<i>Guardian will win this, hands down.</i>

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:00.630
<i>B36.</i>

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:04.010
<i>Moving to B37.</i>

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:05.210
<i>B37?!</i>

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:07.590
<i>Wait, that's where...</i>

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:10.090
<i>I have spotted the Key!</i>

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:12.050
Damn that Oonishi!

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:15.480
He can find Kagari from that far out?

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:17.920
<i>What could I even do there?</i>

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:20.240
<i>I'd be up against several superhumans!</i>

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:21.710
Don't rewrite

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:21.710
Rewrite

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:22.710
Rewrite

00:06:28.850 --> 00:06:30.990
<i>Okay, now I can catch up!</i>

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:42.710
Isn't that the monster that killed Mikuni?

00:06:51.190 --> 00:06:52.470
Is that you, Tennouji?

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:54.560
I'll call for medics right away.

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:56.950
Forget me. Go after Oonishi.

00:06:56.950 --> 00:06:58.840
He found it.

00:06:58.840 --> 00:07:00.810
We have to kill it.

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:02.160
Go.

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:05.190
I'll deal with this myself.

00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:18.480
Oonishi.

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:19.470
Tennouji?

00:07:19.470 --> 00:07:21.080
It's good you're here.

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:24.000
I'm fighting a summoner.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:25.090
They're strong.

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:26.800
Everyone else got taken out.

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:28.070
A summoner?

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:29.840
They're defending the Key.

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:31.450
Their numbers?

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:33.070
Three monsters.

00:07:33.070 --> 00:07:34.970
I took out one,

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:38.570
but the other two... They're...

00:07:41.550 --> 00:07:44.080
T-Ten... nou...

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:54.890
Did you set your monsters on them?

00:07:54.890 --> 00:07:56.480
Y-Yeah.

00:07:56.850 --> 00:08:00.160
I knew you'd pull this crap eventually.

00:08:00.890 --> 00:08:02.540
But I...

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:06.420
You are under no duty or obligation 
to take part in this war!

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:12.550
Where's Kagari?

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:19.060
<i>I destroyed Guardian's eyes.</i>

00:08:19.320 --> 00:08:23.050
<i>Gaia's summoners shouldn't be 
able to act for a while, either.</i>

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:35.620
<i>Is this a side effect of the rewrite?</i>

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:40.450
Kagari?

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:45.390
Kagari!

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:49.140
You okay?!

00:08:49.140 --> 00:08:50.130
Damn!

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:51.460
K-K...

00:08:51.850 --> 00:08:52.710
Kagari!

00:09:01.670 --> 00:09:03.310
Kotarou...

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:08.100
I'm sorry I used you as bait.

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:20.660
So you failed to find the Key?

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:21.620
Yes.

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:23.750
What happened to your hand?

00:09:24.070 --> 00:09:26.500
I hurt myself.

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:51.060
What's going on?

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:04.580
Don't look down on us, Guardian!

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:10.210
Good grief.

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:13.310
Talk about pushy.

00:10:14.770 --> 00:10:15.460
Now...

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:17.830
Would you come with us?

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:26.720
Let me warn you in advance.

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:28.870
Should it be freed from my shackles,

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:30.480
Martel will go out of control.

00:10:31.070 --> 00:10:35.110
You just unleashed that monster into the wild.

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:38.150
Y-You're...

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:45.660
I expected them to have 
obtained the Key by now.

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:48.290
We must get more men on the search.

00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:54.290
<i>The conflict only got worse by the day.</i>

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:56.420
No time...

00:10:56.950 --> 00:10:57.940
Kagari?

00:10:57.940 --> 00:11:00.600
Won't make... in time...

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:05.510
<i>Ever since that day, Kagari had 
lost her way with words.</i>

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:06.430
Hurry.

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:07.930
Need hurry.

00:11:08.220 --> 00:11:09.500
I know.

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:11.400
But it's dangerous out there right now.

00:11:11.720 --> 00:11:13.660
Everyone's looking for you.

00:11:13.660 --> 00:11:14.860
Sad...

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:16.750
Very sad...

00:11:17.140 --> 00:11:19.320
Hey, how about we watch some TV?

00:11:19.550 --> 00:11:21.920
<i>A planet 18 light years away</i>

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:25.710
<i>has been found to have water and 
an atmosphere, just like Earth.</i>

00:11:25.710 --> 00:11:26.580
Planet?

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:30.330
<i>NASA's research team is currently...</i>

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:28.940
Planet...

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:30.330
Water.

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:32.920
They're called Earth-like planets.

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:34.700
And they're pretty close.

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:37.750
Like, only around 20 to 30 
light years from here.

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:39.060
Go.

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:40.340
Uh, not happening.

00:11:40.790 --> 00:11:41.660
Close.

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:43.730
I meant when compared to science fiction.

00:11:43.730 --> 00:11:45.370
Not like we have rockets 
that can go there.

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:46.390
Purchase.

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:47.450
Buy.

00:11:47.450 --> 00:11:48.760
As if!

00:11:48.760 --> 00:11:50.010
Online.

00:11:50.010 --> 00:11:51.350
They don't sell rockets.

00:11:52.590 --> 00:11:56.000
Well, people might be able to go someday.

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:58.360
Take a cruise on an ark or something.

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:01.500
Wh-What?

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:03.150
Keep going.

00:12:03.150 --> 00:12:06.650
But moving to another planet 
is a huge undertaking.

00:12:06.650 --> 00:12:08.800
It'd take a few thousand years, at least.

00:12:08.800 --> 00:12:10.320
Hurry.

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:12.370
Again, it's currently impossible.

00:12:12.780 --> 00:12:15.970
But I'm trying to bring you 
fond memories instead.

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:20.690
It's the eve of the Harvest Festa tomorrow.

00:12:20.690 --> 00:12:23.950
Both forces are clashing, and the 
forest has become a war zone.

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:26.010
And the Key hasn't been found yet.

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:28.080
Have your wounds healed?

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:31.870
I can't retire over that. 
I wouldn't be much of a superhuman.

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:32.630
How about you?

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:34.330
Your hand still not healing?

00:12:34.330 --> 00:12:35.020
Nope.

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:36.390
By the way...

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:37.930
When'd you give birth?

00:12:37.930 --> 00:12:39.240
I did not.

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:42.920
These girls are Nakatsu Shizuru-chan 
and Konohana Lucia-chan,

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:44.400
superhumans like us.

00:12:45.210 --> 00:12:48.740
I want to be a teacher here someday.

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:50.030
What, at Kaza High?

00:12:50.380 --> 00:12:53.690
Guardian is planning a project that'd 
send superhumans to study there.

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:56.130
And I'd be there to back them up.

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:57.750
So are those two...

00:12:57.750 --> 00:12:59.790
Yeah, two of the candidates.

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:03.050
That's a stylish eyepatch, missy.

00:13:03.370 --> 00:13:04.630
And this one's a healthy eater.

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:05.710
Gimme a bite.

00:13:05.710 --> 00:13:06.680
Nope.

00:13:07.210 --> 00:13:08.850
Aren't you jumping the gun?

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:10.620
It's no more than a few years away.

00:13:11.070 --> 00:13:13.270
Back when I attended that school,

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:14.680
I had a lot of fun.

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:18.690
I want these girls to experience that joy, too.

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:20.090
Got it.

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:21.270
You have my full support.

00:13:21.270 --> 00:13:23.040
So the three of us losers

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:26.070
have all found our own path to walk, huh?

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:28.070
Once again, I'm glad to be 
teammates with you guys.

00:13:30.390 --> 00:13:32.530
You know you're supposed to place 
your hands on mine, right?

00:13:32.530 --> 00:13:34.870
Take a hint! It's to show we're comrades!

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:36.330
Oh, is that it?

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:38.690
All right, then.

00:13:38.690 --> 00:13:39.870
Show...

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:40.710
...we're comrades.

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:41.960
Yeah.

00:13:49.560 --> 00:13:51.350
<i>Suzaki was right on the money.</i>

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:55.100
<i>Kashima Sakura immediately 
set her plans in motion.</i>

00:13:56.870 --> 00:13:58.690
<i>Suzuki Bondo's role is over.</i>

00:13:59.450 --> 00:14:02.190
<i>The time has come to go back 
to being Tennouji Kotarou.</i>

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:04.700
<i>I've received the proposal.</i>

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:05.830
<i>I don't see any problems.</i>

00:14:05.830 --> 00:14:07.290
<i>Great job.</i>

00:14:07.290 --> 00:14:09.200
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:11.690
<i>This will be your final order.</i>

00:14:11.690 --> 00:14:12.670
<i>Let's begin.</i>

00:14:13.230 --> 00:14:15.510
<i>I always knew this day would come,</i>

00:14:15.510 --> 00:14:18.040
<i>but I still cried a little just now.</i>

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:20.690
<i>Thanks for everything.</i>

00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:23.890
<i>I'm sorry I sacrificed so many years of your life.</i>

00:14:24.490 --> 00:14:28.190
<i>I won't waste the chance you 
gave me for a fresh start.</i>

00:14:28.190 --> 00:14:31.500
<i>I'll make sure to see how the world 
changes with my own eyes.</i>

00:14:32.020 --> 00:14:33.950
<i>I'm closing the chat.</i>

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:36.010
<i>Goodbye, Jasmine.</i>

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:39.060
<i>Farewell, my beloved family.</i>

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:42.730
<i>I hope you'll find a good planet.</i>

00:14:45.390 --> 00:14:49.220
<i>The truth that Gaia and Guardian 
have both kept hidden</i>

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:51.410
<i>will soon come to light.</i>

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:54.090
<i>Once they learn the whole 
story, people will change.</i>

00:14:54.090 --> 00:14:56.390
<i>No, they will be forced to change.</i>

00:14:56.780 --> 00:14:58.860
<i>With the planet slowly but surely dying,</i>

00:14:58.860 --> 00:15:01.210
<i>the only resource it has left is life itself.</i>

00:15:01.700 --> 00:15:03.730
<i>And the time has come to dip into it.</i>

00:15:04.940 --> 00:15:07.910
Kagari, we begin tomorrow.

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:12.240
Let's go witness that moment together.

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:15.080
Will the "fond memories"

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:17.860
involving the whole planet 
really be that beautiful?

00:15:20.280 --> 00:15:21.310
Let's go see.

00:15:22.710 --> 00:15:24.490
Let's watch it all from atop that hill.

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:28.190
No way.

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:30.700
So many summoners?

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:32.540
Kashima Sakura must've ordered it.

00:15:32.540 --> 00:15:34.270
That withered old bag.

00:15:34.270 --> 00:15:35.120
What do we do?

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:37.370
Initiate an emergency deployment!

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:40.210
Nishikujou, ask HQ for additional manpower.

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:41.620
Y-Yes, sir!

00:15:51.610 --> 00:15:52.750
Kagari?

00:16:04.250 --> 00:16:06.070
<i>Where could she have gone?</i>

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:09.400
<i>It has to be either the power spot 
where she was born, or that hill.</i>

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:12.650
Finally found you.

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:15.350
Kotori.

00:16:15.350 --> 00:16:17.910
You're acting kind of scary.

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:20.410
I feel like you'd disappear if I left you alone.

00:16:21.110 --> 00:16:23.890
Hey, why are you helping Kagari?

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:25.790
Why, indeed?

00:16:26.440 --> 00:16:29.680
Don't you have the choice of not helping her?

00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:31.270
This planet will fall to ruin.

00:16:31.270 --> 00:16:32.800
What can we do, then?

00:16:33.150 --> 00:16:37.050
The only chance we have is 
to create fond memories.

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:41.060
We must show off humanity's potential 
to the planet. In other words...

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:42.990
I don't care about that!

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:43.860
That's...

00:16:43.860 --> 00:16:46.710
That's not what I'm talking about!

00:16:46.710 --> 00:16:47.940
The promise...

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:49.540
Promise?

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:53.440
You never showed me around the Harvest Festa!

00:16:54.260 --> 00:16:57.030
You remember something from that long ago?

00:16:57.850 --> 00:16:59.580
I guess we're all alike...

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:01.970
You, me, and Kagari.

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:03.450
Kagari?

00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:04.910
That's right.

00:17:04.910 --> 00:17:06.710
Kagari's all alone, too.

00:17:07.570 --> 00:17:10.000
It's not that I don't sympathize with you,

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:12.090
but I'm sorry.

00:17:13.030 --> 00:17:14.880
I'm going to choose Kagari.

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:21.670
Why?

00:17:21.670 --> 00:17:23.580
Why would you do that?!

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:25.770
I've been planning to do this for ages.

00:17:26.070 --> 00:17:28.350
Why are you always so...

00:17:28.350 --> 00:17:29.870
You see, Kotori,

00:17:29.870 --> 00:17:33.080
I always saw you as a nuisance.

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:35.950
You were a total pain.

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:37.780
But I feel great now.

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:40.260
You always disgusted me,

00:17:40.260 --> 00:17:41.780
so this serves you right.

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:46.160
I...

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:47.690
I hate you!

00:17:47.690 --> 00:17:49.330
Just die!

00:17:52.240 --> 00:17:54.110
See you, Kotori.

00:18:03.170 --> 00:18:05.890
Our eyes have reported spotting 
something that resembles the Key.

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:08.060
Okay. Order them to move out.

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:16.320
I'm stealing your move, Luis.

00:18:16.800 --> 00:18:17.760
Rewrite

00:18:16.800 --> 00:18:17.760
Don't

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:18.800
Rewrite

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:25.540
Get there!

00:18:27.360 --> 00:18:29.920
Distance to target: 500...

00:18:30.550 --> 00:18:31.850
400...

00:18:33.790 --> 00:18:36.000
The helicopter crashed?

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:37.780
What the heck was that?

00:18:37.780 --> 00:18:38.670
A spear?

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:39.680
Was it a superhuman?

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:42.180
Don't tell me it was that rat.

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:53.080
Kagari.

00:18:53.080 --> 00:18:54.650
The hiking trip is canceled.

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:56.410
Let's get out of here.

00:18:56.760 --> 00:18:58.030
You're...

00:18:58.030 --> 00:18:59.160
Good, Kagari.

00:18:59.160 --> 00:19:01.030
Stay in control of yourself.

00:19:01.480 --> 00:19:03.860
The planet will cease...

00:19:03.860 --> 00:19:05.290
We don't know that yet.

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:07.250
The world is about to change.

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:10.160
The conflict between Gaia and 
Guardian will end very soon, too.

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:12.350
Humanity will die...

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:14.280
Don't give up until you see what happens.

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:18.660
The song's growing more powerful...

00:19:21.850 --> 00:19:22.370
What?

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:23.750
This thing suddenly showed up!

00:19:22.790 --> 00:19:23.750
What is that?

00:19:23.750 --> 00:19:24.680
It looks dangerous!

00:19:32.050 --> 00:19:34.190
Perish, humanity.

00:19:41.850 --> 00:19:43.200
What's going on?

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:46.440
Looks like this is it...

00:19:46.440 --> 00:19:47.680
Damn it!

00:19:51.740 --> 00:19:53.250
<i>This pressure...</i>

00:19:53.660 --> 00:19:54.960
<i>There's a formidable foe here!</i>

00:19:55.440 --> 00:19:56.270
Intercept

00:19:55.440 --> 00:19:56.270
Rewrite and intercept

00:19:55.440 --> 00:19:56.270
Run

00:19:55.440 --> 00:19:56.270
Rewrite, then run

00:19:56.270 --> 00:19:57.440
Rewrite and intercept

00:19:57.670 --> 00:19:58.830
Sorry, Kagari.

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:00.360
Give me some time.

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:21.230
Figures.

