00:20:52.190 --> 00:20:53.540
<i>Is this it?</i>

00:20:54.210 --> 00:20:55.080
Give up

00:20:54.210 --> 00:20:55.080
Don't give up

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:56.210
Give up

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:23.310
Let's call it a day, then.

00:21:23.310 --> 00:21:25.440
I'm sorry, Esaka-san.

00:21:25.890 --> 00:21:27.470
I've done something awful.

00:21:27.780 --> 00:21:29.220
What are you saying?

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:32.250
It's easy to remain pure, even for the weak.

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:36.230
But only the strong can be winners.

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:39.000
You're strong.

00:21:39.910 --> 00:21:41.190
Hold your head high.

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:44.310
I've been betraying you forever

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:48.760
and protecting what you call the Key.

00:21:48.760 --> 00:21:50.780
What will you do with the Key?

00:21:51.130 --> 00:21:53.480
Show her my last piece of work.

00:21:53.880 --> 00:21:56.160
If that stops her from wiping us out,

00:21:56.530 --> 00:21:58.200
we'll have a future filled with promise.

00:21:58.880 --> 00:21:59.950
Is that so?

00:22:00.430 --> 00:22:02.550
Very well, then.

00:22:02.760 --> 00:22:05.850
I won't let all your work go to waste.

00:22:05.850 --> 00:22:07.800
That is my plan.

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:08.550
Good.

00:22:08.900 --> 00:22:10.390
Now go.

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:13.470
People don't die so easily.

00:22:13.860 --> 00:22:17.810
I won't ever forget all the things you taught me.

00:22:18.340 --> 00:22:19.830
Thank you very much!

00:22:21.060 --> 00:22:23.230
Hurry up and go.
